    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "re-union 那晚。望遠鏡抬回來以後，大家玩 Killer。家綸答應洗碗，人卻在圈裡。素婷牽著他的手。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨跟芷君在廚房洗碗。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "難道他們不應該在一起嗎？素婷現在不是相當幸福嗎？",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "要是她真的那麼幸福，你幹嘛現在又這麼擔心？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "她擦乾最後一隻碟，回到大廳。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "大鼻說人多了不好玩。芷君提議 Truth or Dare。阿俊搶過撲克牌來派。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "寶方問大鼻有沒有喜歡的女孩子。大鼻說有，第二問不肯答。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第五回。會長問素婷。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "huizhang",
      "text": "你跟家綸是怎麼在一起的？",
      "expr": "04-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "huizhang"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "不就是大家都是莊員，認識多了，相熟了……就在一起了嘛。",
      "expr": "03-worry"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "huizhang",
      "text": "第一天是怎樣開始的？是家綸向你求愛嗎？",
      "expr": "01-calm"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "huizhang"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "沒有甚麼第一天啦。大家喜歡大家，順其自然的……就在一起了啦。",
      "expr": "05-spring"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "家綸臉紅。綺珊叫下一個。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "寶方問芷君有沒有男朋友。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "分手了。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第十一回合，阿俊問綺珊。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "你是不是喜歡凌晨？",
      "expr": "01-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "痴線！",
      "expr": "05-wink"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他問了又問，還說要是轉 Dare，就讓她錫凌晨一啖。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "qishan",
      "text": "沒有啊！沒有喜歡呀！真是神經病！",
      "expr": "05-wink"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第十三回。家綸問凌晨。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "選 Dare",
          "jump": "ch16-pick"
        },
        {
          "text": "讓他問",
          "jump": "ch16-ask"
        }
      ]
    }
